        "id": 1042276
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-10-15T18:42:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just curious, in what case would it need to retry to recover?  Should we just report an error here?  Could this be an infinite loop?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "dac18cec3a3a90b40b53fbc330d6a670b4e52f05",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4bedf7b0_f80acfb3",
        "filename": "tests/hostside/java/android/virt/test/VsockTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 76,
      "author": {
        "id": 1059815
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-10-19T12:15:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The thread is executed with a timeout (line 83), so it will get killed eventually. We retry because it takes a while for the VM to boot at register its vsock device. Until then the client binary reports a device-not-ready error. I\u0027ve simplified the code in the new PS - have a look. Hope it makes more sense.",
      "parentUuid": "d34c50c1_6f62498e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "dac18cec3a3a90b40b53fbc330d6a670b4e52f05",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f86424a8_95a6f7a1",
        "filename": "tests/hostside/java/android/virt/test/VsockTest.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 76,
      "author": {
        "id": 1139038
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-10-19T13:31:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would there be any advantage to initially having the client in the VM that connects to the server in the host on VMADDR_CID_HOST (2)? I guess it\u0027s still a race, just a more biased one.",
      "parentUuid": "4bedf7b0_f80acfb3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 76,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 76,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "dac18cec3a3a90b40b53fbc330d6a670b4e52f05",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3746cae5_ab6eb02f",
        "filename": "tests/hostside/java/android/virt/test/VsockTest.java",
