      "writtenOn": "2020-10-19T15:22:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Have a look at the new PS. I\u0027ve encountered just one problem: executeShellV2Command does not allow the task to be interrupted. So if the VMM crashes, the server continue to listen until it times out. I\u0027ll file a bug with Tradefed - the underlying RunUtil class has a setting for this, it\u0027s just not enabled.",
